<h2>Selected experience and impact</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Enterprise architecture and modernization (2025–present):</strong> Led or contributed substantially to Azure App Service migration work, containerization, Key Vault integration, runtime identity configuration, deployment pipelines, staging automation, and operational readiness.</li>
<li><strong>Domain-driven design:</strong> Built workflow/rules capabilities with aggregate-oriented behavior and CQRS patterns, facilitated DDD sessions, reviewed architecture across team boundaries, and documented reference implementations and standards for AI-assisted changes.</li>
<li><strong>Distributed hosting infrastructure:</strong> Built a remote hosting management and update-delivery system deployed across more than 2,000 servers, with functionality spanning IIS, file management, certificates, Windows services, and administration.</li>
