<h2>How I approach engineering</h2>
<p>I start with the business problem, expected operating conditions, and the constraints that actually matter. I prefer domain-oriented modeling where behavior is complex, deliberate dependencies, maintainable interfaces, and architectures that can evolve without requiring a big-bang rewrite. I consider deployment, observability, security, testing, and the next engineer who has to maintain the code as part of the design.</p>
<h2>Technical focus</h2>
