<li><strong>Cloud and operations:</strong> Azure App Service, Key Vault, App Configuration, Service Bus, containers, Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions, monitoring, CI/CD.</li>
<li><strong>Frontend and mobile:</strong> TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Next.js, Vite, React Native/Expo, UI integration and end-to-end testing.</li>
<li><strong>Data and quality:</strong> SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Cosmos DB, query and index tuning, xUnit, NUnit, Playwright, Cypress.</li>
