<h2>Leadership without losing the implementation</h2>
<p>My preferred role combines deep individual technical contribution with architecture guidance and cross-team enablement. I've presented domain modeling concepts through working slices, guided reviews, and created written implementation standards so architectural intent is easier to carry into future features.</p>
